  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"x-section e3134-e1 m2f2-0\"><div class=\"x-container max width e3134-e2 m2f2-1\"><div class=\"x-column x-sm x-1-1 e3134-e3 m2f2-2\"><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline mtn h4\"><span>Nederasselt, Holland, April 2018</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"x-section\" id=\"x-section-1\"><div class=\"x-container max width\" id=\"\"><div class=\"x-column x-sm x-1-1\"><div class=\"x-video embed\"><div class=\"x-video-inner\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline cs-ta-left mtn h4\"><span>Andrew Cohen interviewed by Patrick Kicken</span></h2><div class=\"x-text cs-ta-left\" id=\"\"><p>On a recent visit to Holland Andrew was interviewed by Patrick Kicken of<a href=\"http://www.nondualiteit.one/\">www.nondualiteit.one</a> for the <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/podcast/advaita-tv/id1125814602\">advaita.tv</a> podcast.</p><p>Patrick asks Andrew to define enlightenment, and the discussion expands into an overview of <a href=\"http://andrewcohen.com/evolutionary-enlightenment/\">Evolutionary Enlightenment</a> and the distinctions between this and traditional enlightenment.</p></div><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><div class=\"x-entry-share\"><p>Share this Post</p></div></div></div></div>",
